  "extra_findings": [
    "F8 — exportarCsv writes to a fixed, predictable path (EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv, lib.php:125-150) that stays on disk after the export. Concurrent exports race on it, it can be read directly if /var/www/painel/tmp is web-served, and the function returns silently when fopen fails. Fixed by streaming to php://output (delivered lib.php:177).",
    "F11 — formatarStatus (lib.php:28-34) maps every status other than 1 and 2, including invalid ones, to 'Resolvido'. Left unchanged on purpose for contract reasons.",
    "SEC (no rate limiting) — the login POST (index.php:21-29) has no brute-force protection. Listed as a deliberate non-change in Decisões #2."
